#: d49942fd26f74ffba3ab3a9a406ee344 e628a46e2c04446dbc1c06542ae1f299
msgid ""
"The options for these are generally self-explanatory however a couple of "
"items are explained in more detail below"
msgstr "这些选项通常不言自明，但以下几项需要更详细的说明"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ekf-sources.rst:17
#: 0bc003ecb34641b997ae18e39c8b8bfd 2b3536e7f1fc464881ef8b83f462fa4d
#: 2c067583a3504170aa4154f8b90e0fd8 581f90cdd0fd43a5b2a2408c49842423
#: 5a752d7320a447fba063c01852ccf417 5bae8dfd7b314f9fb9d28c5fc19bae24
msgid "The :ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSZ<EK3_SRC1_POSZ>` source options are:"
msgstr ":ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSZ<EK3_SRC1_POSZ>` 源选项为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ekf-sources.rst:19
#: 2a4eae24f57f4adaad9e5d042323299f 6c522f5d351346599f043f3f80160740
#: 6d84ec4ad44b4e9ba857c94fefe52e5f a42c39a890f244849b7ecf16ce36777f
#: efe74b4e9ae84a868425c681f150a984 fec21dfbb15647868ec9cfe767b4d6a9
msgid ""
"Option 1: Baro is the default and works well for most vehicles and "
"situations.  If a GPS is also present the EKF may be configured to slowly "
"correct the altitude to match the GPS by setting :ref:`EK3_OGN_HGT_MASK "
"<EK3_OGN_HGT_MASK>` to 5 (e.g. 1:Correct when using Baro height + 4:Apply "
"corrections to local position)."
msgstr ""
"选项 1：气压计是默认选项，适用于大多数飞行器和场景。如果还有 GPS，可通过将 :ref:`EK3_OGN_HGT_MASK "
"<EK3_OGN_HGT_MASK>` 设置为 5（例如 1：使用气压计高度时校正 + 4：将校正应用于本地位置），将 EKF 配置为缓慢修正高度以匹配"
" GPS。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ekf-sources.rst:20
#: 03c2307e7e9442579c6969f01404307e 07731364d1ae47f3a02ce008e77dec05
#: 0b31c33b5964494c8726b4142f373e11 69f7b7ac9e4a40c79e1aa03f0d3195e2
#: c410353cb1864658b4ba94413c788fad d32696b010e44498a7ee4f892c620a3e
msgid ""
"Option 2: RangeFinder should almost never be used.  This is only appropriate"
" for indoor use where the floor is flat with no ground clutter (e.g. no "
"chairs, boxes, etc).  Please note that :ref:`Surface Tracking "
"<copter:terrain-following-manual-modes>` and :ref:`Terrain Following "
"<terrain-following>` do not require the EKF to use the rangefinder at all"
msgstr ""
"选项 2：测距仪几乎不应使用。此选项仅适用于室内地面平坦且无地面杂物（如无椅子、箱子等）的场景。请注意，:ref:`地面追踪 "
"<copter:terrain-following-manual-modes>` 和 :ref:`地形跟随 <terrain-following>` "
"并不要求 EKF 使用测距仪"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ekf-sources.rst:21
#: 20d02c9fae924d95baf28115215c2e04 3813314fdc724c4290d2ca36875a3f66
#: a0bfcff7344f42ee9181297e87b929e4 c25d36ebee4a43498529c476c6dc71c1
#: ceee63cb261549bf8a381e170e968fd1 eb3fc839ac8c4cacbf23dc18c7fa910d
msgid ""
"Option 3: GPS is only recommended if the vehicle will fly long duration "
"flights where the air pressure may change significantly **and** the vehicle "
"has a high quality GPS (e.g. UBlox F9P dual band).  In case of GPS failure "
"the EKF will fallback to using the barometer (if present)"
msgstr ""
"选项 3：GPS 仅在飞行器将进行长时间飞行（期间气压可能显著变化） **且** 飞行器配备高质量 GPS（如 UBlox F9P "
"双频）时推荐使用。GPS 失效时，EKF 将回退到气压计（如有）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ekf-sources.rst:22
#: 01d0e708ce4f4419a60907d478209317 0b2c4de38e9743c1ab5500437ee632cd
#: 0bcbde75f6a044f6976d52e152683b7e 0f27b1873f1543f1a71ecdcefdc6c955
#: 3444633227f24552a1968b4d341a3aa7 882f69612b75408689901cb923c1c78e
msgid "Option 4: Beacon may be useful when beacons are used in place of a GPS"
msgstr "选项 4：信标，当信标替代 GPS 使用时可能有用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ekf-sources.rst:23
#: 142a84fe46384e01a2632af36dfeb429 2b4168f4a7eb4e99933b43c1a89a0438
#: 557ea6330c864f04abc8006a62ce1fe6 7bd14b3e4af543228fb57f37d4a709c1
#: 83d1c04bfc994a9e99f03cf39b832b2a d53f496c0616408c83aaf80542c8206f
msgid ""
"Option 6: ExternalNav may be used when a companion device provides a "
"position estimate"
msgstr "选项 6：ExternalNav，当伴飞计算机提供位置估计时使用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ekf-sources.rst:25
#: 041adbe0026e4d878d2fff665bc83643 2469e9df25be4a18ad76b45b92350c05
#: 668b0f6ed5664401b328dc9fc254934a b3fa59f21a5143e4adb23caf6be509a9
#: c8d61da02b2a4c66b66c4d4df442a3e2 da12dde9c29c4372be08990de8412279
msgid "The :ref:`EK3_SRC1_YAW<EK3_SRC1_YAW>` source options are:"
msgstr ":ref:`EK3_SRC1_YAW<EK3_SRC1_YAW>` 源选项为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ekf-sources.rst:27
#: 228e07b46f27434c866d70108c38c19f 424fbd0351f5495ba02afda848df7e6e
#: 524aefa1837c4bf4abeb1bfd998f4393 64cf2f8cda2d4e7fa335d1b1efa0c799
#: 8f9443405d3e405199c9e25bbd46dc7d fd654813e9484b6291b95cade88fe05b
msgid "Option 1: Compass is the normal default."
msgstr "选项 1：罗盘是通常的默认选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ekf-sources.rst:28
#: 081bcdb7ff6f449d9070cf6ce63cb525 321902c532384cb688f1bb1272070382
#: 6674bdc04cb3447383ec63d7940befdd 7b35b6acf22a47ea9513999da35b3037
#: be35381d9fb04d5c9e715b7baeed2699 ed82311593f045169d294c2ad070abba
msgid ""
"Option 2: GPS is used with GPS that can supply yaw (see :ref:`common-gps-"
"for-yaw`)"
msgstr "选项 2：GPS，与可提供偏航角的 GPS 配合使用（参见 :ref:`common-gps-for-yaw`）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ekf-sources.rst:29
#: 09f9f5c51c63447ba79b39aa8c3b32b0 2e9b6d831bac41129e987a387aee1de7
#: 2f7ab41f27504d5dbb5364fc5bc84328 d2b6743547714cf9a40a14c38475066b
#: dd9facfd2b36422281bd9dc9cc8a2860 f91aababa0a349468a6b931e63e1afdf
msgid ""
"Option 3: GPS with compass fallback is the same as GPS option, but while it "
"has GPS yaw available it learns compass offsets to make the compass yaw "
"match the GPS yaw. This means that if you lose GPS yaw while flying then the"
" compass is ready to takeover immediately, with a smooth change from GPS yaw"
" to compass yaw."
msgstr ""
"选项 3：GPS 带罗盘回退，与 GPS 选项相同，但在 GPS 偏航可用时会学习罗盘偏移，使罗盘偏航与 GPS 偏航匹配。这意味着如果飞行中失去 "
"GPS 偏航，罗盘可以立即接管，从 GPS 偏航平滑过渡到罗盘偏航。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ekf-sources.rst:30
#: 29ca69e3fe1f435d86c38d8f9fe49a9a 2f3a00f233d842c2a5f53dace1a727ca
#: 43d6e2c2bf754f7cae30ce478a6f147b 5ed4abaa63834398abd5eb9fb8a62181
#: 891181da9e70412285436ed97dc31035 c14b71e881d84dca8e72d98302580f3f
msgid ""
"Option 6: ExternalNav is used when a companion device is providing yaw "
"information"
msgstr "选项 6：ExternalNav，当伴飞计算机提供偏航信息时使用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ekf-sources.rst:31
#: 1d63a879d5b04b328519b77fd51054d3 42f386f822ea4dfab5ee21f6f3395667
#: 5edc0a6a4bca4b35ab1b58e14a8ef62c 6e2213233f5d4e1694dd64b22feb9a81
#: 9e49806daec54918b2db635af539389e b0977a07367e4f9ca2b6b48c4e0b771e
msgid ""
"Option 8: GSF (Gaussian Sum Filter) provides yaw information based on GPS "
"velocity and position changes and Plane will automatically use this in "
":ref:`compass-less <common-compassless>` configurations,even if not "
"selected. Copter requires this to be set explicitly in these configurations."
msgstr ""
"选项 8：GSF（高斯和滤波器），基于 GPS 速度和位置变化提供偏航信息。在 :ref:`无罗盘 <common-compassless>` "
"配置中，固定翼将自动使用此选项，即使未选择也如此。多旋翼飞行器需要在此类配置中显式设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ekf-sources.rst:34
#: 3fd9b68fccec485a84d42919e204973e 71017ecbe5cd4870ad6dbd8f1ed23fea
#: 7cd9305e3a17494289149b020ddc00b7 8bf3ff68d6a94c92a32a8c8636e67ddb
#: ab49d34ee08c4d4da61ef7a65c30752a f5f6f79331db40f0b71905f1e1848d57
msgid "Source Switching"
msgstr "源切换"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ekf-sources.rst:36
#: 07ff2ae75959415082339d540f0e3bab 314474992d0e43a4bbb47216f323f123
#: 82e72072d1ed46219a8994be90b200e7 9e02b1d0ce4f42c8a3285ad6f76596f2
#: e4c91bd1ee864e98b209c910c549baa8 e8baf4b0c2ae4d0e98101eebdf0dd995
msgid ""
"Three sets of EKF position and velocity source parameters are provided and "
"by default the 1st set is used (e.g. the _SRC1 set)."
msgstr "系统提供三组 EKF 位置和速度源参数，默认使用第 1 组（即 _SRC1 组）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ekf-sources.rst:38
#: 241ee0483f5a41a28dd6feacb7ba9036 6bfa5ba4352f430082f3bda585bb17c9
#: cc397d3169a341558dccc4f7020ba8b5 d37fd3708ded49fc8feeddee643f7a9b
#: d4acd9ccdad54f68aba38a940db9eff5 f1977f1aa71c4c88869637e39e00f70b
msgid ""
"The active set can be selected via an :ref:`RC auxiliary switch <common-"
"auxiliary-functions>` (e.g. set ``RCx_OPTION`` to \"90\" / \"EKF Source "
"Set\")."
msgstr ""
"可通过 :ref:`遥控辅助开关 <common-auxiliary-functions>` 选择活跃组（例如，将 ``RCx_OPTION`` "
"设置为「90」/「EKF Source Set」）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ekf-sources.rst:40
#: 4c30e54511884a85a926a8a2eec85fc0 5f6dccb9ee504e86ad1e0dda64062e4c
#: 6112f2b0f2ad477babb2c5b0f93df35d 684c2fe8139f461da35cb24859ff8f2d
#: 701215f745344ef4a32c963b4a2cad1b 98d629e89a5b4a3a951e18a434c712ce
msgid ""
"Ground stations or companion computers may set the source by sending a "
"`MAV_CMD_SET_EKF_SOURCE_SET  "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/ardupilotmega.html#MAV_CMD_SET_EKF_SOURCE_SET>`__"
" mavlink command but no GCSs are currently known to implement this."
msgstr ""
"地面站或伴飞计算机可通过发送 `MAV_CMD_SET_EKF_SOURCE_SET  "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/ardupilotmega.html#MAV_CMD_SET_EKF_SOURCE_SET>`__"
" MAVLink 指令来设置源，但目前尚无已知地面站实现此功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ekf-sources.rst:42
#: 297d593ae45a4748af445ba4add80e4d 3504d9e675574337ab34af453d95a182
#: 47acfcc35d024b39bce3709d77b31512 57b5f7068c5b44b1aef7d46c49239773
#: 7ea91947d3c04e54896015d4a800903b ca89c12ad43d4f9e864eacc5b6627361
msgid ""
"This feature is especially helpful when using :ref:`common-non-gps-to-gps`."
msgstr "此功能在使用 :ref:`common-non-gps-to-gps` 时尤为有用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ekf-sources.rst:45
#: ../../source/docs/common-ekf-sources.rst:47
#: 0d3473eb4d0f41e7a0472f7441e21062 73d0141ecdd84a2aba387def2679ae02
#: 84e734ceecb246d6836e00433c901370 a200e0beef0f4148a2128e4674ebcc06
#: a65b8aa4568e4f50aa5d5fcdd5526799 d0f7fca8b6284e17af81cc8eeddb3398
msgid "Velocity Source Fusing"
msgstr "速度源融合"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ekf-sources.rst:47
#: ../../source/docs/common-ekf-sources.rst:49
#: 0c200c80d47f4219bb77402429bab74d 82041e3f56e240fa907f3c6865710289
#: b0123e8cfaba4b53b357f5c6485f4faf bc6295bcb8ce43ff917fc34b796252fb
#: dc16adb7025b4a4f81d7a3e4eef9ce72 ef5887ee52f94127bf77408767b53141
msgid ""
"There is an option to fuse all sources of velocity into the EKF.  This will "
"take velocity information from the XY and Z sources defined by "
":``EK3_SRCx_VELXY`` and ``EK3_SRCx_VELZ``, where 'x' is the source number "
"(1-3).  To enable this option set the first bit in the "
":ref:`EK3_SRC_OPTIONS<EK3_SRC_OPTIONS>` bitmask."
msgstr ""
"有一个选项可将所有速度源融合进 EKF。这将从 :``EK3_SRCx_VELXY`` 和 ``EK3_SRCx_VELZ`` 定义的 XY 和 Z "
"源获取速度信息，其中 'x' 为源编号（1-3）。要启用此选项，请设置 :ref:`EK3_SRC_OPTIONS<EK3_SRC_OPTIONS>` "
"位掩码的第一位。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ekf-sources.rst:49
#: 8ce971a971b247edb1e0c2394344e296
msgid ""
"When using this option, users should ensure that the velocity measurements "
"being provided to the EKF are both in the same reference frame/co-ordinate "
"system."
msgstr "使用此选项时，用户应确保提供给 EKF 的速度测量数据处于相同的参考系/坐标系中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ekf-sources.rst:54
#: ../../source/docs/common-ekf-sources.rst:56
#: 2c0cff8907a7406f8b80ca0039a7d99a 2cde11136c694d3d83d14975d272cc02
#: 2faa7865fdbb4354a72c6260b922e4fd 34253fb7ad084fa4bf4bf29e81d12020
#: 44a015d272384d88bc3639d387c64e90 54594556ceb14d9d96a168c1d82af1d8
msgid "ExternalNAV/Optical Flow Transitions"
msgstr "ExternalNAV/光流过渡"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ekf-sources.rst:56
#: ../../source/docs/common-ekf-sources.rst:58
#: 143ce8ff0e2649ab80af4434c8ed9537 91a372a0200b47a6a9f7f7b7a795c146
#: e8143311eaf546d2a2713982e6428d03 ed6f54fa3eab4267a5a15818281990f7
#: f7a8526d71414be5b978f178fad4adf4 fd36783cfb4f4732a8bd16557f78ce37
msgid ""
"When switching between Optical Flow XY velocity and/or positioning as "
"sources for EKF3 to an ExternalNAV source, such as 3D Camera, you can set "
":ref:`EK3_SRC_OPTIONS<EK3_SRC_OPTIONS>` bit 1 to keep the ExternalNAV "
"aligned with the OpticalFlow to avoid position/velocity bumps upon "
"switching."
msgstr ""
"在将光流 XY 速度和/或位置作为 EKF3 源切换到 ExternalNAV 源（如 3D 相机）时，可将 "
":ref:`EK3_SRC_OPTIONS<EK3_SRC_OPTIONS>` 第 1 位设为 1，使 ExternalNAV "
"与光流保持对齐，避免切换时出现位置/速度跳变。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ekf-sources.rst:58
#: ../../source/docs/common-ekf-sources.rst:60
#: 313c0bd9f00d40b6973c165c1c306ab4 37bf20595c96419e863c7ebcbd6146b6
#: 5ca001aa82f74ce4b2d6157a4932a371 5eb7309634094fe79f1289a2dc485415
#: 75e787fc05724fb4b3ca2bfd993145c7 d74baa0b2c114c8bba734248d5e47578
msgid ""
"For example, you could setup a 3D camera as an external position and "
"velocity source:"
msgstr "例如，可将 3D 相机设置为外部位置和速度源："

